# Huawei VRP display interface status parser.
#
# Extracts the interface name and link status from a display interface
# status table. Used as the D-10 pre-filter step before parsing the
# transceiver table (only up ports carry plugged optics).
#
# Sample input (minimal; the on-site Huawei S8700 sample for display
# interface status was not captured — RESEARCH §Wave 0 / 48-02 T2b).
# Test fixture uses inline minimal output like:
#   10GE5/0/4  up   10G  Full  fiber  ...
#   10GE5/0/6  down 10G  Full  fiber  ...
#
# Field semantics:
#   INTERFACE — device interface name (10GE5/0/4, GE1/0/24, ...).
#   STATUS    — "up" or "down".

Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value STATUS (up|down)

Start
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+.*$$ -> Record
